\pard\b\fs20 Acid Bridge\b0\par
\fs16\par
At the outermost edge of their realms, the clans Rustuff and H\'f6rx search for treasure.\par
The treasure hunters reach the burned lands around the acid bridge with only a few clonks and a flag. Luckily for them, they found an abandoned stone hut there and began to build their settlement.\par
In the ground of this land the clonks find precious crystals, and they learned to use them for their magical doings.\par
